  briefEnglish: "Protect both bases. Destroy both spawners and clear the remaining ghosts.\n\nDrive to the fence. Scout and mark targets with the drone.\nCHECK your circuit, dock the tablet, then press [R] and ENGAGE.\n\n[ENTER]   BEGIN"
  briefChinese: "守住两个基地，摧毁两处出生点，再清除剩余敌人。\n\n开车到电网外，用无人机侦察并投放信标。\n检查电路，插入平板，按 R 拿出遥控器并点击迎战。\n\n[ENTER]   出发"
